    "descrizione": "In a dominant position but not far from the sea, we offer for sale a splendid independent villa of recent construction.\n\nThe house is divided into 2 bodies, one built from scratch in 2005 and one in 2015 for a total of 400 square meters and is divided as follows: in the body arranged on 2 levels, on the ground floor there is a 90 sqm living room with fireplace, a 40 sqm living room with a staircase leading to the upper floor, the 18 sqm dining room with adjacent kitchen; both these rooms have access to the terrace and garden on the east side. The large 50 sqm living area has a fireplace and access to the south balcony and the garden with swimming pool. On this same floor the house has 2 double bedrooms, 1 bathroom with whirlpool tub, 1 with shower, and a service bathroom.\n\nIn the more recent part of the house, however internally connected, there are 4 large bedrooms, 3 bathrooms and a laundry room.\n\nThe underfloor heating and cooling system is independent for the 2 parts of the villa and is integrated with a diffused dehumidification system.\n\nThe surrounding land is planted with olive trees in strips for a total of 4000 square meters, the property is completely fenced, and access is via an electric gate.\n\nThe villa on the ground floor has an inspectable cavity wall that completely isolates the walls from the ground, ensuring the healthiness of the rooms.\n\nThe house is equipped with an underground cistern of 40,000 liters for the recovery of rainwater usable for automatic irrigation of the garden.\n\nThe solar panels guarantee the production of domestic hot water and the heating of the swimming pool and whirlpool water; the latter are independent of each other and are equipped with 2 pumps for water replacement and filtration.\n\nThe terrace with pergola to the south-east of the house is 30 sqm, while the one in front of the outdoor kitchen is 70 sqm.",
