    "descrizione": "Voghera – One villa, a thousand possibilities\n\nThere are houses you buy. And then there are houses you imagine, transform, and turn into the place where you build your future.\n\nIn one of the most sought-after residential neighborhoods of Voghera, we offer for sale a splendid detached villa built in 1985, nestled in the greenery of its private garden with a vegetable patch and trees—an oasis of tranquility where you can experience every season in total privacy.\n\nWith a total area of approximately 410 sqm, the property is divided into three residential units:\n\n* A 190 sqm apartment, spacious and bright.\n* A 170 sqm apartment, perfect for a second family or to create an independent living solution.\n* A 50 sqm habitable attic, ideal as a studio, guest apartment, or space dedicated to your hobbies.\n\nCompleting this prestigious property are a spacious tavern, three garages, and a large garden that makes this villa perfect for those who love outdoor living.\n\nThe property is structurally in excellent condition and offers the opportunity to be customized according to your own style. The bathrooms in the ground floor apartment and the attic have already been renovated, while those on the upper floor can be updated to further enhance the home.\n\nThis villa is the ideal solution for:\n\n* large families;\n* parents and children who wish to live close by while maintaining their independence;\n* professionals looking for a space to use as a studio;\n* investors interested in a property with great potential.\n\nSpace, independence, tranquility, and endless possibilities for customization: these are the qualities that make this property a rare opportunity on the market.\n\nContact us to receive more information and book a visit. You may have found the home you have been waiting for.",
